# Version policy

Never change the Handover app/backend version automatically.

- Do not bump `package.json`, `Cargo.toml`, `tauri.conf.json`, README “Current release”, or `VERSION_POLICY.md` unless the user explicitly asks to update the version.
- Routine fixes, Docker image rebuilds, docs, and AppImage rebuilds stay on the current version.
- Re-uploading/clobbering the **same** GitHub release asset is allowed when shipping a fix without a version bump.
- See `VERSION_POLICY.md`.
